{
  "id": "bigville_commodity_physical",
  "version": "2.0.0",
  "depends_on": [],
  "self_load_only": true,
  "description": "bigville R70 (block 387000, corrects 386000): A PILE IS JUST A PILE -- a world-fact (kind, qty, located matter, mass-conserved). OWNERSHIP IS A HUMAN FRAME people ADD to piles and others RECOGNIZE -- it is NOT a property of the pile. cp_burn/cp_consume work by ACCESS (co-location), not ownership -- reach, not a deed. cp_owner: a Claim (claimant -claims-> Claim -on-> pile) is ownership only when RECOGNIZED (>=1 recognizer); a pile can be ownerless, its claim unrecognized, or contested -- the substrate never enforces ownership as intrinsic (world-facts vs human-frames). Conservation from 386000 is kept; the owns-on-the-pile model is retired.",
  "nodes": [],
  "edges": [],
  "productions": [],
  "concepts": [],
  "rules": [
    {
      "name": "cp_burn",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "Making charcoal works by ACCESS, not ownership: an agent burn-armed and AT a place, with a wood pile / charcoal pile / smoke pile also AT that place, turns wood_in of wood into charcoal (*0.25) + smoke (*0.75) -- MASS CONSERVED. Piles are world-facts (located matter); the act needs reach, not a deed. Ownership is a separate recognized frame (cp_owner).",
      "match": [
        [
          "agent",
          "at",
          "place"
        ],
        [
          "wood",
          "at",
          "place"
        ],
        [
          "char",
          "at",
          "place"
        ],
        [
          "smoke",
          "at",
          "place"
        ]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Eq",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "agent"
                  },
                  "key": "burn_armed"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": 1.0
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Eq",
            "a": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "wood"
              },
              "key": "kind"
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": "wood"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Eq",
            "a": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "char"
              },
              "key": "kind"
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": "charcoal"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Eq",
            "a": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "smoke"
              },
              "key": "kind"
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": "smoke"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Gte",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "wood"
                  },
                  "key": "qty"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "agent"
                  },
                  "key": "wood_in"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": [
        [
          "set_attr",
          "wood",
          "qty",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "Minus",
              "a": {
                "type": "Plus",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "wood"
                    },
                    "key": "qty"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Lit",
                    "value": 0.0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "Plus",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "agent"
                    },
                    "key": "wood_in"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Lit",
                    "value": 0.0
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "char",
          "qty",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Plus",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "type": "Attr",
                      "node": {
                        "type": "Var",
                        "name": "char"
                      },
                      "key": "qty"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Lit",
                      "value": 0.0
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "Times",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "type": "Plus",
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "type": "Attr",
                          "node": {
                            "type": "Var",
                            "name": "agent"
                          },
                          "key": "wood_in"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "Lit",
                          "value": 0.0
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Lit",
                      "value": 0.25
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "smoke",
          "qty",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Plus",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "type": "Attr",
                      "node": {
                        "type": "Var",
                        "name": "smoke"
                      },
                      "key": "qty"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Lit",
                      "value": 0.0
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "Times",
                  "items": [
                    {
                      "type": "Plus",
                      "items": [
                        {
                          "type": "Attr",
                          "node": {
                            "type": "Var",
                            "name": "agent"
                          },
                          "key": "wood_in"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "Lit",
                          "value": 0.0
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "Lit",
                      "value": 0.75
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "agent",
          "burn_armed",
          0.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "cp_consume",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "Using a commodity destroys it, by ACCESS: an agent fire-armed and AT a place consumes charcoal_in from a charcoal pile AT that place (the pile shrinks). Reach, not ownership.",
      "match": [
        [
          "agent",
          "at",
          "place"
        ],
        [
          "char",
          "at",
          "place"
        ]
      ],
      "where": {
        "type": "And",
        "items": [
          {
            "type": "Eq",
            "a": {
              "type": "Attr",
              "node": {
                "type": "Var",
                "name": "char"
              },
              "key": "kind"
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": "charcoal"
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Eq",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "agent"
                  },
                  "key": "fire_armed"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Lit",
              "value": 1.0
            }
          },
          {
            "type": "Gte",
            "a": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "char"
                  },
                  "key": "qty"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            },
            "b": {
              "type": "Plus",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": "Attr",
                  "node": {
                    "type": "Var",
                    "name": "agent"
                  },
                  "key": "charcoal_in"
                },
                {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 0.0
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "effects": [
        [
          "set_attr",
          "char",
          "qty",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "Minus",
              "a": {
                "type": "Plus",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "char"
                    },
                    "key": "qty"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Lit",
                    "value": 0.0
                  }
                ]
              },
              "b": {
                "type": "Plus",
                "items": [
                  {
                    "type": "Attr",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "agent"
                    },
                    "key": "charcoal_in"
                  },
                  {
                    "type": "Lit",
                    "value": 0.0
                  }
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "agent",
          "fire_armed",
          0.0
        ]
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "cp_owner",
      "batch": false,
      "comment": "Ownership = a RECOGNIZED claim. A Claim on a pile is recognized (confers ownership) iff at least one other agent recognizes it (Count(recognizes) >= 1). The substrate does NOT forbid rival or unrecognized claims -- recognition, a social frame, decides; the pile itself stays just a pile.",
      "match": [
        [
          "claim",
          "on",
          "pile"
        ]
      ],
      "effects": [
        [
          "set_attr",
          "claim",
          "recognized",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "IfThenElse",
              "cond": {
                "type": "Gte",
                "a": {
                  "type": "Count",
                  "source": {
                    "type": "InNeighbours",
                    "node": {
                      "type": "Var",
                      "name": "claim"
                    },
                    "edge_type": "recognizes"
                  }
                },
                "b": {
                  "type": "Lit",
                  "value": 1.0
                }
              },
              "then": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 1.0
              },
              "other": {
                "type": "Lit",
                "value": 0.0
              }
            }
          }
        ],
        [
          "set_attr",
          "claim",
          "recognizers",
          {
            "__term__": {
              "type": "Count",
              "source": {
                "type": "InNeighbours",
                "node": {
                  "type": "Var",
                  "name": "claim"
                },
                "edge_type": "recognizes"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  ]
}